{"id": "86323", "name": "פונקציה מעריכית 9^x – הפלט עבור קלט נתון (באנגלית)", "defaultgrade": 1, "penalty": 0, "options": {"multiplicationsign": "dot", "complexno": "i", "matrixparens": "[", "inversetrig": "cos-1", "logicsymbol": "lang", "sqrtsign": true}, "nhints": 0, "questiontext": "<div dir=\"ltr\" style=\"max-width:980px;font-family:Arial;line-height:1.7\"><div style=\"background:#F4F1F5;border:1px solid #D9D1DD;border-radius:12px;padding:14px 16px\"><p>A function \\( f : R \\rightarrow R\\) (where \\(R\\) denotes the real numbers) is defined by the rule</p><p dir=\"ltr\" style=\"text-align:center\">\\[  f(x) = {{CT:0}} \\]</p></div><div style=\"border:1px solid #D9D1DD;border-radius:12px;padding:14px 16px;margin:14px 0;overflow-x:auto\"><p>What is the output of the function \\(f\\), when the input is {{CT:1}} ?</p><div style=\"background:#FAF9FB;border-radius:8px;padding:10px;direction:ltr;text-align:center;unicode-bidi:isolate\">[[input:ans1]]</div><div dir=\"ltr\" style=\"direction:ltr;text-align:center;unicode-bidi:isolate;margin-top:6px\">[[validation:ans1]]</div></div></div>", "generalfeedback": "<div dir=\"ltr\" style=\"max-width:980px;font-family:Arial;line-height:1.7\"><div style=\"background:#F4F1F5;border:1px solid #D9D1DD;border-radius:12px;padding:12px 16px;margin-bottom:12px\"><b style=\"color:#4b1f6f\">Outline:</b> Substitute the input into the rule, then write \\(9=3^2\\), which turns the power of 9 into a power of 3 with an integer exponent.</div><div style=\"border:1px solid #D9D1DD;border-radius:12px;padding:14px 16px;margin:12px 0;overflow-x:auto\"><b style=\"color:#4b1f6f\">Step 1 — Substitute the input</b><br>You need to evaluate the function at the value of \\(x\\), i.e. substitute \\(x={{CT:2}}\\) in the rule:<p dir=\"ltr\" style=\"text-align:center\">\\[ f({{CT:2}}) = 9^{({{CT:2}})} \\]</p></div><div style=\"border:1px solid #D9D1DD;border-radius:12px;padding:14px 16px;margin:12px 0;overflow-x:auto\"><b style=\"color:#4b1f6f\">Step 2 — Laws of exponents</b><br>Write the base as a power of 3, \\(9=3^2\\), and use the law \\(\\left(a^m\\right)^n=a^{mn}\\):<p dir=\"ltr\" style=\"text-align:center\">\\[ 9^{({{CT:2}})}=\\left(3^{2}\\right)^{({{CT:2}})}=3^{{{CT:3}}} \\]</p>[[if test=\"{{CT:6}}\"]]Hence<p dir=\"ltr\" style=\"text-align:center\">\\[ f({{CT:2}}) = 3^{{{CT:3}}} = {{CT:4}}. \\]</p>[[else]]A negative exponent means the reciprocal, \\(a^{-k}=\\dfrac{1}{a^{k}}\\). Hence<p dir=\"ltr\" style=\"text-align:center\">\\[ f({{CT:2}}) = 3^{{{CT:3}}} = \\frac{1}{3^{{{CT:5}}}} = {{CT:4}}. \\]</p>[[/if]]</div></div>", "specificfeedback": "<p>[[feedback:Result]]</p>", "prtcorrect": "<p><span class=\"correct\">Correct answer, well done.</span></p>", "prtpartiallycorrect": "<p><span class=\"partially\">Your answer is partially correct.</span></p>", "prtincorrect": "<p><span class=\"incorrect\">Incorrect answer.</span></p>", "inputs": [{"name": "ans1", "type": "algebraic", "boxsize": 20, "insertstars": 0, "forbidfloat": true, "forbidwords": "solve", "allowwords": "", "mustverify": true, "showvalidation": 1, "syntaxhint": "", "syntaxattribute": 0, "options": "", "requirelowestterms": true}], "prts": [{"name": "Result", "value": 1, "autosimplify": false, "feedbackstyle": 1, "feedbackvariables": "", "firstnode": 0, "nodes": [{"name": 0, "answertest": "AlgEquiv", "sans": "ans1", "tans": "correctanswer", "testoptions": null, "quiet": false, "on_true": {"scoremode": "=", "score": 1, "penalty": 0, "nextnode": 1, "answernote": "Result-0-T ", "feedback": ""}, "on_false": {"scoremode": "=", "score": 0, "penalty": 0, "nextnode": -1, "answernote": "Result-0-F ", "feedback": "<div dir=\"ltr\"><div dir=\"ltr\"><div dir=\"ltr\"><div dir=\"ltr\"><div dir=\"ltr\"><div dir=\"ltr\">You should evaluate the function at the given point.</div></div></div></div></div></div>"}}, {"name": 1, "answertest": "EqualComAss", "sans": "ans1", "tans": "correctanswer", "testoptions": null, "quiet": false, "on_true": {"scoremode": "=", "score": 1, "penalty": 0, "nextnode": -1, "answernote": "Result-2-T", "feedback": ""}, "on_false": {"scoremode": "=", "score": 0, "penalty": 0, "nextnode": -1, "answernote": "Result-2-F", "feedback": "<div dir=\"ltr\">Please perform the calculation and enter the exact value (an integer or a fraction).</div>"}}]}], "qvnames": ["correctanswer", "f1", "k3", "k3m", "n1"], "nvariants": 11}